<title>UK: Danone unit sets 200 bln lire capped FRN.</title>
<headline>Danone unit sets 200 bln lire capped FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following capped floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Banca Monte dei Paschi di Siena.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DANONE FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIRE  BASE	*6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    09.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+36 BP    PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  ISS PRICE  100.50    FULL FEES   0.70</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 REOFFER    99.90     LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 DENOMS (M)  5-50</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  0.40</p>
<p> NOTES	NO COUPON WILL BE MORE THAN 36 B.P. HIGHER THAN</p>
<p>		ITS PREDECESSOR.</p>
<p> NOTES	BANKERS TRUST IS OUT OF ORDER MANAGER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
